tion environments that provide the ability to create and access virtual workspaces for managing documents, discussions, lists, surveys and other important contextual information such as team member status and presence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="639899">WSS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1968640">SharePoint Services</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12540_55239_1969889"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A temporary property of a user-interface object, such as a window, view, dialog box, or button, that permits the object to receive keyboard input from the user. The focus is usually conveyed through highlighting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="55239">focus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1969889">focus</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12551_237304_1967641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A formula syntax that allows the user to refer to list and pivot data in a friendlier way.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237304">Structured References</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="c