OS resources (files, folders registry keys) and prevents applications and administrators from making changes to a computer's resources in an arbitrary way.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="310257">System Protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1770824">Protecció del sistema</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14232_231970_1967742"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that provides interactive analysis of data, like a PivotTable report. You can change views of data, see different levels of detail, or reorganize the chart layout by dragging fields and by showing or hiding items in fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231970">PivotChart report</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1967742">informe de gràfic dinàmic</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14237_169312_2770137"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A database that functions as a backup of a primary database, receiving copies of every change to the primary database, and that can take over traffic if the primary database becomes unavailable.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169312">mirror database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote>