alues, by showing each slice of the pie as "pulled out," or separate, from the whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1485421">exploded pie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1967768">gràfic circular seccionat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16468_588931_1967768"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pie chart that displays the contribution of each value to a total while emphasizing individual values, by showing each slice of the pie as "pulled out," or separate, from the whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="588931">exploded pie chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1967768">gràfic circular seccionat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16469_1373758_1967413"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that plots numerical data along two value axes (x,y).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1373758">point chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1967413">gràfic de dispersió</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfS