rocessor. "Itanium architecture-based" refers to systems or platforms that are based on the Itanium and Itanium2 processors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211415">Itanium</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1569452">Itanium</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25992_1253847_1651268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An online community where members can virtually socialize by posting and commenting on a newsfeed, by chatting, and by sharing photos, images, articles, and other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253847">social network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1651268">xarxa social</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="25992_2696313_1651268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An online community where members can virtually socialize by posting and commenting on a newsfeed, by chatting, and by sharing photos, images, articles, and other content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2696313">network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1651268">xarxa social</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26000_1256398_3175441"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft program designed to provide a consistent experience for Microsoft partners to obtain real-world customer feedback on Microsoft pre-release products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256398">Technology Adoption Program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175441">TAP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26000_1256398_3183341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft program designed to provide a consistent experience for Microsoft partners to obtain real-world customer feedback on Microsoft pre-release products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256398">Technology Adoption Program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3183341">Technology Adoption Program</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26000_1256411_3175441"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft program designed to provide a consistent experience for Microsoft partners to obtain real-world customer feedback on Microsoft pre-release products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256411">TAP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175441">TAP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26000_1256411_3183341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft program designed to provide a consistent experience for Microsoft partners to obtain real-world customer feedback on Microsoft pre-release products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256411">TAP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3183341">Technology Adoption Program</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26004_1256406_1970757"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A short summary of the contents of a document that gives the reader a quick overview of its topic and purpose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256406">abstract</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970757">resum</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26007_1256417_1969451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A cache that is used internally to optimize page rendering by storing properties of sites, page layouts, and pages. It reduces the amount of traffic between the Web server and a SQL database. This results in higher throughput of rendered pages, thereby increasing the number of pages that can be delivered to clients.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1256417">object cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1969451">memòria cau d'objectes</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2602_144805_1967383"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A variable that's declared in the Declarations section of a module by using the Private keyword. These variables are available to all procedures in the module.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144805">module-level variable</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1967383">variable de nivell de mòdul</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26050_1262328_2802694"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To merge information from multiple places into one.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262328">consolidate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2802694">consolidar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26061_1262339_1968384"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft SharePoint Server 2010 service application that allows users to share and view Visio web drawings using Visio Services. The service application also enables data-connected Microsoft Visio 2010 web drawings to be refreshed and updated from a variety of data sources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262339">Visio Graphics Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1968384">Servei de gràfics del Visio</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26062_1262341_1970673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that enables users to view (in full fidelity) and share Visio files in SharePoint Server without having the Visio client installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262341">Visio Web Access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970673">Visio Web Access</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26062_1262341_1970676"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that enables users to view (in full fidelity) and share Visio files in SharePoint Server without having the Visio client installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1262341">Visio Web Access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970676">element web del Visio Web Access</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26062_1275257_1970673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web Part that enables users to view (in full fidelity) and share Visio files in SharePoint Server without having the Visio client installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275257">Visio Web Access Web Part</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970673">Visio Web Access</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGe