ion">Software that secures, monitors, manages, and supports mobile devices deployed across mobile operators, service providers, and enterprises.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042111">MDM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3004858">MDM</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35591_2042111_3004859"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software that secures, monitors, manages, and supports mobile devices deployed across mobile operators, service providers, and enterprises.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042111">MDM</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3004859">administració de dispositius mòbils</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35592_2042112_2046376"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A partially completed diagram that includes shapes and tips to help the user get started in Visio. A user can select from three diagrams at startup.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042112">Starter Diagram</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2046376">Diagrama inicial</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35606_2042664_2046368"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that manages the ability to share various components of the Office 365 site (such as Outlook calendars, SharePoint sites, and Lync meetings) with visitors or external users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042664">External sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2046368">Ús compartit extern</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35607_2042666_2046373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that renders a PDF document as a single or series of pictures in a page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042666">PDF Render</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2046373">Representació de PDF</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35608_2042671_2046374"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables IT administrators to move Personal Folders files (.pst) to a mailbox in Office 365. A .pst file is a data file that stores your messages and other items on your computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2042671">PST import</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2046374">importació de PST</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3561_168804_1968129"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows a user to share documents or applications with others. The user can also choose to give another person control of an application or the user's computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="168804">application sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1968129">ús compartit d'aplicacions</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35632_2045864_2049145"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A HIP challenge that requires a user to view an image and then type a set of characters contained in that image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2045864">visual challenge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2049145">verificació visual</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35633_2045865_2049140"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security task that a user must complete to verify they are a human and not a machine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2045865">challenge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2049140">verificació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35636_2277612_2281573"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office 365 subscription service for nonprofit organizations (up to 5 PCs, Macs, or mobile devices) that includes Word, PowerPoint, Excel, Outlook, OneNote, Publisher, Access, and Lync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2277612">Office 365 ProPlus for Nonprofits</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2281573">Office 365 ProPlus per a organitzacions sense ànim de lucre</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35640_2046824_2067285"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An offer from Microsoft Office 365 for nonprofit organizations that offers additional storage options for SharePoint Online, priced per gigabyte, to support an organization's SharePoint Online growth.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2046824">SharePoint Online Storage for Nonprofits</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067285">Emmagatzematge del SharePoint Online per a organitzacions sense ànim de lucre</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35641_2046825_2067278"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An offer from Microsoft Office 365 for nonprofit organizations that is a personal email archive for users who have mailboxes on Microsoft Exchange Server 2010.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2046825">Exchange Online Archiving for Nonprofits</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2067278">Exchange Online Archiving per a organitzacions sense ànim de lucre</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="35645_2046828_2599832"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">All data, including all text, sound, image files, or software, given to Microsoft by, or on behalf of, Customer or its Affiliates through use of an Online Service or in connection wit