hicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42888_2432494_2436095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that allows users to use ink to draw using their mouse, finger, or an inking tool, and whose ink resembles traditional pen ink.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432494">pen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436095">bolígraf</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42889_2432495_2436101"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that is activated when clicked once, and when clicked a second time, opens a menu that allows the user to modify the mode of the selected tool.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2432495">secondary action button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436101">botó d'accions secundàries</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42890_2432497_2436104"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu that is opened via a secondary action button and that gives users one or more options for changin