, so the user can look around ​as if they are inside the video itself. It can be played on a PC, p​hone, Xbox, or AR/VR headset.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2466452">360° video</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469074">vídeo de 360º</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43714_2466503_2469078"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The branded spatial sound format that Microsoft is offering ​for headphones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2466503">Windows Sonic for Headphones</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469078">Windows Sonic per a auriculars</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43717_2466997_2469088"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 10 designed for small and medium businesses that includes the features of Windows 10 Pro, plus additional management policies that can be helpful to business customers. This edition is only available through subscription as part of a larger package of services, and is not available as a standalone download.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2466997">Windows 10 Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469088">Windows 10 Business</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43729_2467028_2915155"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The icon that shows when someone @mentions somebody, likes something that person has posted, or replies to a thread somebody has started.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467028">Activity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2915155">Activitat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43730_2467029_2915487"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A subunit of a team in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467029">channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2915487">canal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43731_2467030_2915614"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action in which @ is added before a teammate's name to get his or her attention.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467030">mention</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2915614">menció</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43733_2467032_2916062"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An organizational unit in Microsoft Teams where members work in channels and use available storage space and tools.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467032">team</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2916062">equip</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43734_2467150_2469073"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Mixed Reality and Windows Holographic, an app type or app state in which the app renders as a flat window, not an immersive experience.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2467150">2D view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469073">visualització 2D</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote typ