s</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468662_2471386"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468662">Ink Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471386">Assistent de matemàtiques</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468663_2471383"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468663">Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471383">Assistent per passar d'entrada manuscrita a matemàtiques</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43749_2468663_2471386"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that converts ink to math equations, then solves those equations and explains them step by step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468663">Math Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471386">Assistent de matemàtiques</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43750_2468667_2903145"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numerical summary of an organization's security posture based on system configurations, user behavior and other security related measurements that represents the extent to which an organization has adopted security controls in their Microsoft environment which can help offset the risk of being breached.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2468667">Secure Score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2903145">puntuació segura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43750_2680639_2903145"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numerical summary of an organization's security posture based on system configurations, user behavior and other security related measurements that represents the extent to which an organization has adopted security controls in their Microsoft environment which can help offset the risk of being breached.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2680639">Microsoft Secure Score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2903145">puntuació segura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43750_2902148_2903145"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numerical summary of an organization's security posture based on system configurations, user behavior and other security related measurements that represents the extent to which an organization has adopted security controls in their Microsoft environment which can help offset the risk of being breached.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2902148">secure score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2903145">puntuació segura</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43761_2469253_2471385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word print layout that allows horizontal movement between pages in a document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469253">Page-Stack navigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471385">Navegació de pàgines horitzontal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43762_2469812_2472269"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Sound that is spatialized or is precisely located around a listener in 3D space. Developers can use spatial sound in an application to convincingly place sounds in a 3D space all around the user. Sounds will then seem as if they are coming from real physical objects even though the user may only be using regular stereo headphones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2469812">spatial sound</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472269">so envoltant</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470183_2472271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470183">variable refresh rate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472271">freqüència d'actualització variable</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470183_2472272"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470183">variable refresh rate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472272">VRR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470196_2472271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470196">VRR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472271">freqüència d'actualització variable</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43768_2470196_2472272"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Technology that enables a 3D graphics processor to display the image at the moment it is rendered for more fluid and better detailed gameplay, and for reducing or eliminating lag, stutter and frame tearing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470196">VRR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472272">VRR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43786_2470552_2915590"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The free mobile app for managing business activities such as jobs, tasks, locations, and scheduling, as well as sending and paying bills.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470552">Kaizala</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2915590">Kaizala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43786_2667577_2915590"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The free mobile app for managing business activities such as jobs, tasks, locations, and scheduling, as well as sending and paying bills.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2667577">Microsoft Kaizala</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2915590">Kaizala</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43799_2470927_2471812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The lightweight markup language with plain text formatting syntax designed to be converted to HTML and other formats and that is used to format readme files, write messages in online discussion forums, and create rich text using a plain text editor.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470927">Markdown</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471812">Markdown</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43800_2470929_2471813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Word add-in that converts Markdown documents to Word format for editing and then converts the Word document back to Markdown format, using the Paragraph, Table, List, and Range objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2470929">Markdown editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2471813">Markdown editor</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4381_132217_1970210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person responsible for creating and maintaining a World Wide Web site. A webmaster is often responsible for responding to email, ensuring the site is operating properly, creating and updating Web pages, and maintaining the overall structure and design of the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="132217">Web master</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970210">administrador web</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4381_132218_1970210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person responsible for creating and maintaining a World Wide Web site. A webmaster is often responsible for responding to email, ensuring the site is operating properly, creating and updating Web pages, and maintaining the overall structure and design of the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="132218">webmaster</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970210">administrador web</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4381_132219_1970210"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person responsible for creating and maintaining a World Wide Web site. A webmaster is often responsible for responding to email, ensuring the site is operating properly, creating and updating Web pages, and maintaining the overall structure and design of the site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="132219">webmistress</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970210">administrador web</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4382_252092_1968885"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A transaction that contains distributions to another company within the same legal entity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252092">intercompany transaction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1968885">transacció d'empreses vinculades</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43827_2472567_2496871"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A movie created in the Photos app, featuring a set of related pictures and videos combined with a soundtrack, transitions and other effects. This term can also be used to refer to the set of photos and videos included in the story. ​A story may be created automatically by the app, or manually by the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472567">story</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2496871">història</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4385_234840_1970226"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An accounting method that recognizes revenues when they are earned and expenses when they are incurred, regardless of when they are received or paid.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234840">accrual accounting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970226">mètode de meritació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4385_315145_1970226"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An accounting method that recognizes revenues when they are earned and expenses when they are incurred, regardless of when they are received or paid.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="315145">accrual basis accounting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970226">mètode de meritació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4385_648634_1970226"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An accounting method that recognizes revenues when they are earned and expenses when they are incurred, regardless of when they are received or paid.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="648634">accrual method</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970226">mètode de meritació</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43870_2472969_2915488"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of videos organized into a playlist dedicated to a specific topic which are designed for users to follow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2472969">channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2915488">canal</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43879_2473454_2480242"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature in Holograms app that allows the user to input text and have that text become a hologram that they can place in their space. User inputs text to make a holographic label.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2473454">holographic label maker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2480242">creador d'etiquetes holo