es not place any additional restrictions on the email.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2706916">Encrypt-Only</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2710648">Només xifratge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48018_2706919_2710645"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Encryption option that ensures that an email stays encrypted and that prevents it from being forwarded, copied, or printed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2706919">Do Not Forward</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2710645">No reenvies</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="48019_2706925_2915179"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The status that indicates a user is online and available to chat and receive calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2706925">Available</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2915179">Disponible</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGe