rious actions, such as file quarantine or deletion of persistence mechanism in the registry, based on the results of a corresponding automated investigation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2879287">automatic remediation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2880415">correcció automàtica</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50965_2879288_2880409"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A query-based proactive threat hunting capability that provides flexible options for locating undetected breach activity as well as network assets that require attention.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2879288">advanced hunting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2880409">localització d'amenaces avançada</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50966_2879289_2880419"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A repository of reports about emerging threats, including specific incidents and campaigns, threat techniques, and vulnerabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2879289">threat analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><nti