-based workspace using intelligence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022553">intelligent speaker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023200">altaveu intel·ligent</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53107_3022590_3023205"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A printing feature where the user initiates a print job, which is then held on their workstation or on a server until it is released by the user at a printing device (i.e., "pulled" to the printer).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022590">pull printing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023205">impressió amb tramesa induïda</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53108_3022591_3023204"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A OneDrive feature that shows a user photos taken on a particular calendar date in the past.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022591">On This Day</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023204">Aquest dia</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNo