ation for end-users to access quarantined and reported messages from Office applications (Outlook, Teams, Office.com).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114829">Defender Messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115144">Missatgeria del Microsoft Defender</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54814_3114837_3115143"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that provides an automated installation and deployment of a defined set of third-party Teams apps.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114837">Auto install approved apps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115143">Instal·lació automàtica d'aplicacions aprovades</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54815_3114838_3115145"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to utilize Python libraries to quickly clean up data, explore the relationships within the data, and use sophisticated AI-powered libraries to analyze the data and make predictions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3114838">Python in Excel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115145">Python a l'Excel</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54832_3115260_3122486"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft 365 Copilot capability that delivers relevant, actionable responses to prompts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115260">Semantic Index for Copilot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3122486">Índex semàntic del Copilot</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54833_3115363_3118270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software extension that augments the capabilities of AI systems, enabling them to interact with APIs from other software and services to retrieve real-time information, incorporate company and other business data, and perform new types of computations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3115363">plugin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3118270">complement</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5484_558224_1969176"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Web site from which users can install and run Dashboard Designer, view product documentation, and open the Dashboard Web Preview site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="558224">Monitoring Central</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1969176">Central de supervisió</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5487_26569_1566102"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Broadly, any device that performs arithmetic operations on numbers. Sophisticated calculators can be programmed for certain functions and can store values in memory, but they differ from computers in several ways: they have a fixed set of commands, they do not recognize text, they cannot retrieve values stored in a data file, and they cannot find and use values generated by a program such as a spreadsheet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26569">calculator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1566102">calculadora</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5492_144959_1967665"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Category labels in a chart that, based on worksheet data, are automatically displayed on more than one line in a hierarchy. For example, the heading Produce might appear above a row with headings Tofu, Apples, and Pears.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144959">multiple-level category labels</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1967665">etiquetes de categoria de nivells múltiples</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54958_3116446_3116758"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The geographically defined boundary consisting of the countries in the European Union (EU) and the European Free Trade Association (EFTA) within which Microsoft has committed to store and process customer data for its major commercial enterprise online services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116446">EU Data Boundary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116758">Frontera de dades de la UE</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="54959_3116447_3116752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To instruct, train, or guide.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3116447">coach</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected