ary is associated with user-defined information that is displayed in the content listing for that library.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="347938">form library</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1969996">biblioteca de formularis</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7802_137953_1970424"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Lightweight paper commonly used for letterhead and other business publications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="137953">bond</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1970424">bond</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7810_557916_1969172"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A supplemental document to the core application questionnaire that is intended to provide a broad overview of PerformancePoint Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="557916">Application Planning and Design Guide</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1969172">Guia de disseny i planificació d'aplicacions</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7814_347948_1968933"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML data file, database, or Web service that is used by a form for the entries in a list box or for script actions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="347948">secondary data source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1968933">origen de dades secundari</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7815_232412_1571192"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to an item that is only visible to an owner, member or other privileged individual.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232412">private</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1571192">privat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7820_145532_1967402"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application or DLL that supplies a linked or embedded OLE object to another application. For example, if an OLE object in an Access database contains a Microsoft Excel worksheet, Excel is the OLE server.</descrip></des