 for a contact that moves the selected contact to the contact group the user selects from a list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184991">Move Contact to</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2508284">Desplaça el contacte a</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7972_234577_1969990"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The option that allows the user to specify the intervals at which an appointment or task will be repeated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234577">Recurrence</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1969990">Periodicitat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="7972_780209_1969990"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The option that allows the user to specify the intervals at which an appointment or task will be repeated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="780209">Repeat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="ca-ES-valencia"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1969990">Periodicitat</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">ESP</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><term